35mmIsle host-only lifetime adaptation, authored 2026-10-14.
Base: Kenix3/libultraship 759b13401cd6903daa67a00a753066f791622e78.
Upstream libultraship is MIT licensed; its LICENSE is preserved in the private
source snapshot. Hunks are generated from immutable git-object bytes at this pin,
with three lines of unified context, not from a mutable reference worktree.
Ship::ControlDeck is the owning base of LUS::ControlDeck at this pin; its private
Window/wheel/controller-bit caches therefore require the ship/controller paths.
This patch adds explicit final-use cache release and safe SDL/OpenGL host teardown,
not game behavior or general multi-context GUI support. Apply only to the freshly
exported build-private snapshot, never to the reference checkout.

